        "risks",
        "alternatives",
        "right-to-stop"
      ],
      "text": "I suggest acupuncture: four fine single-use sterile needles — at the inner wrist and the inner lower leg on each side — for about twenty minutes. It may help you relax and sleep; the evidence is limited. Risks are small: soreness, bruising, feeling faint. Just as important: no kopi after lunch, a regular bedtime, and don't drive when you feel sleepy. If it doesn't improve, your doctor can help further. You can tell me to stop at any time."
    }
